{"sha":"9dd36e882dd372f264b77b179130948aa5adcbde","node_id":"C_kwDOUFWPlNoAKDlkZDM2ZTg4MmRkMzcyZjI2NGI3N2IxNzkxMzA5NDhhYTVhZGNiZGU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Pavlo Tvardovskyi","email":"shtomko@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-28T21:54:45Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-28T21:54:45Z"},"message":"Merge pull request #9 from vijaygopalbalasa/feat/judge-protocol-rvr-v0\n\nfeat(profile): add Judge Protocol ERC-8183 ruling profile","tree":{"sha":"5d51b50a39683db0844098741bd2fc31fb5a8bcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/recomputable-verification-receipts/git/trees/5d51b50a39683db0844098741bd2fc31fb5a8bcc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/recomputable-verification-receipts/git/commits/9dd36e882dd372f264b77b179130948aa5adcbde","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquuIlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAe0MQAGjMPHI5JIoojvF81MprcTG9\nRoml5mcKEZSz78D17Bn/PKyY1cQ3Wd3aimMUqTTpgrSb8KTxjyVpJnzJzF12RC4Y\nhJUv0p5oud09D6KuIO/BQw4yECaD1LI0vZlJ2wevMR0oghuqdlJA3K4SL7d4hFLl\nAsZH3QCefaVp3hdiTJrNJKHfHpfnZ3rUTuTFWGPyFSktzPLuBjq601ExVi7nd3BX\neXVwmaRAdCwclSfETJUjgqAk8tSfldhGlIy0mx4JJLiHL5ZQb3XqhuT1rx5mYTlM\nj7WTYlLyf2pswpZe9aNogGWFpby6ml4OJaTht6hOiGL0e2TENbr+brpZQ20Tecx8\nblnarKkqWEQ4r/y2X2OX5AvOoQgg0is18/aPmuDADaNPBgMf4nXC3tmGVjmck8qz\nwubhg1g3AbheQbrIOHNDoWBjpxTU2CykTnWnZ4ST0MvMyNFVQSWt1rjUyTa/Z3R5\nJ9w0A8DWhxNALf+mxHmOaip0WJnMmDhiJY1UnlfSM456ftvUe0O9rmMVOZex8Ayw\nqQ9W9mgSKW2CGT6/fg3iSDpv3/P6Dy3iXtP55V5qCjVuzH2c5pSyvA1ldL2GAuWC\n+gU1w40w1+bnnhCP1CtBDnd0GtvpQJFLLN6NNnsa5ZwAsyAMflqOZv7VIvUMRw8X\nROxF8gigjsJEQOdtsRbQ\n=Ng59\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5d51b50a39683db0844098741bd2fc31fb5a8bcc\nparent 287c0ea1c2578c1833405bc2476975f95addbada\nparent 54f6b2fd1fe09c72482512e02fef48aaa47d486a\nauthor Pavlo Tvardovskyi <shtomko@gmail.com> 1790632485 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790632485 -0400\n\nMerge pull request #9 from 